  {
    "screen": "video-scaffold-voice-timing-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "默认的图文页路线：在分镜表的 narration 里填已有音频，原文和时间文件随音频一起登记，可用 take 只取原文中的一段。需要新配音的分镜路线：把已确认旁白写成 script_NN.txt，再运行 `run.ps1 tts` 和 `timing`；已有音频先核对身份，不匹配时审阅后明确 force。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **先检查旁白和旧音频**　图文页路线核对音频、原文和时间文件是否成套；分镜路线核对每段脚本非空、编号一致，旧音频不属于当前文案就请人决定是否重做。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
